# Dataset

**Dataset Name:** Iris Dataset

**Source:** UCI Machine Learning Repository

**Dataset Link:**  
https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/53/iris

## Dataset Description

The Iris dataset contains 150 flower samples belonging to three species: Setosa, Versicolor, and Virginica.

It includes four numerical input features:

- Sepal length
- Sepal width
- Petal length
- Petal width

The target variable represents the flower species.
